# /public/build is deliberately NOT ignored.
#
# Deployment here is a manual `git pull` on the server with no build step. The
# layout now serves the compiled Tailwind bundle rather than the Play CDN, so
# if the built files are not in the repo the site arrives with no stylesheet at
# all — @vite throws when public/build/manifest.json is missing.
#
# The cost is that whoever changes a Blade file has to run `npm run build` and
# commit the result alongside it, or new Tailwind classes will not be in the
# stylesheet. See README.
/public/hot
/public/storage
/storage/*.key
/storage/pail
/vendor
/bootstrap/cache/*
Homestead.json
Homestead.yaml
Thumbs.db

# Local static previews generated during development
public/_preview-*.html
